{%- comment -%}
  Velto: name of a sort option. Shopify's own names are long and, in Russian, clumsy
  ("Рекомендуется", "Лидер продаж") — ours live in locales (velto.sort.<value>); an
  option we have no name for keeps Shopify's.
  Params: option (sort option)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign velto_sort_key = 'velto.sort.' | append: option.value | replace: '-', '_'
  assign velto_sort_name = velto_sort_key | t
  assign velto_sort_probe = velto_sort_name | downcase
  if velto_sort_name == blank or velto_sort_probe contains 'translation missing'
    assign velto_sort_name = option.name
  endif
-%}
{{- velto_sort_name | strip_html | escape -}}
